// 933 missing-accent duplicates e.g. AQUI/AQUÍ, 12 OCR "L"/"I" bugs).
// Pass 2: applied clitic-pronoun detection (Spanish attaches object
// pronouns directly to infinitives/imperatives -- e.g. RECUÉRDAME,
// OLVÍDELO -- which Hunspell alone doesn't always recognize, especially
// once the required stress-accent shift lands anywhere in the stem, not
// just the final letter) and diminutive-suffix detection (-ITO/-ITA/
// -CITO/-CITA etc., another highly productive Spanish pattern). This
// rescued 469 genuinely valid words that would otherwise have been wrongly
// deleted (e.g. PONME, HABLARLO, POBRECITO, RECUÉRDAME, PRUÉBALO).
// The remaining 2571 Hunspell-unrecognized words were removed --
// overwhelmingly fictional character/franchise names from the same
// shared-bootstrap contamination pattern found across every language in
// this project (DUMBLEDORE, KATARA, NARUTO, KREE, INVERNALIA/Winterfell,
// RIVERDALE, MONTAUK), plus spurious-accent bugs (DIOS misspelled DIÓS,
// VAS misspelled VÁS) and outright garbled fragments. A small number of
// genuine words were likely lost in this final removal, the same
